{"2557020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eon Rush", "steam_appid": 2557020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eon Rush is a session-based co-op Action RPG for 1-4 players.  Real teamwork. Endgame-level combat from match one. <br>Built for MOBA and ARPG fans looking for fresh challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No 100-hour grind to get to an endgame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No level-gap lockouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No “sorry, you’re too low level to play with us.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in. Choose Eon Stone powerups. Trigger devastating Fusions. Finish a full run in 15-20 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557020/extras/890a39c704dd016125c6b39a707dedaa.poster.avif?t=1783603445\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557020/extras/890a39c704dd016125c6b39a707dedaa.webm?t=1783603445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557020/extras/890a39c704dd016125c6b39a707dedaa.mp4?t=1783603445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY TOGETHER. ALWAYS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most ARPGs split friends apart. Level 20 can't queue with level 70. Someone always has to catch up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not here. Progression enhances your options, not your access. New players and veterans squad up instantly. Skill and coordination matter more than hours logged.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL CO-OP. NOT STAT AURAS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities interact through the Fusion system. Freeze + Shock. Burn + Heavy Impact. Marked targets detonating at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't &quot;stand near ally for +5% damage.&quot; It's coordinated combo windows, battlefield-wide chain reactions, and run-defining team synergy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY RUN BUILDS DIFFERENTLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Eon Stones during each expedition: run-based upgrades that reshape your abilities. Modify skills. Amplify status interactions. Unlock new Fusion paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earlier choices shape later options. No two runs feel the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHORT SESSIONS. FULL ARC.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission escalates through structured combat phases, optional high-risk objectives, mini-bosses, multi-phase boss fights, and competitive 2v2 PvP arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win or lose, you finish a complete arc in one focused session. No 45-minute doomed matches. No filler.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION WITHOUT THE GRIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, unlock permanent loadouts, Guardian Vault upgrades, and Tactical Calldown abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't grind to reach the real game. You're already playing it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eon Rush is a session-based co-op Action RPG for 1-4 players.  Real teamwork. Endgame-level combat from match one. <br>Built for MOBA and ARPG fans looking for fresh challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No 100-hour grind to get to an endgame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No level-gap lockouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No “sorry, you’re too low level to play with us.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in. Choose Eon Stone powerups. Trigger devastating Fusions. Finish a full run in 15-20 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557020/extras/890a39c704dd016125c6b39a707dedaa.poster.avif?t=1783603445\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557020/extras/890a39c704dd016125c6b39a707dedaa.webm?t=1783603445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557020/extras/890a39c704dd016125c6b39a707dedaa.mp4?t=1783603445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY TOGETHER. ALWAYS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most ARPGs split friends apart. Level 20 can't queue with level 70. Someone always has to catch up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not here. Progression enhances your options, not your access. New players and veterans squad up instantly. Skill and coordination matter more than hours logged.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REAL CO-OP. NOT STAT AURAS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities interact through the Fusion system. Freeze + Shock. Burn + Heavy Impact. Marked targets detonating at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't &quot;stand near ally for +5% damage.&quot; It's coordinated combo windows, battlefield-wide chain reactions, and run-defining team synergy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY RUN BUILDS DIFFERENTLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Eon Stones during each expedition: run-based upgrades that reshape your abilities. Modify skills. Amplify status interactions. Unlock new Fusion paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earlier choices shape later options. No two runs feel the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHORT SESSIONS. FULL ARC.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission escalates through structured combat phases, optional high-risk objectives, mini-bosses, multi-phase boss fights, and competitive 2v2 PvP arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win or lose, you finish a complete arc in one focused session. No 45-minute doomed matches. No filler.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION WITHOUT THE GRIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, unlock permanent loadouts, Guardian Vault upgrades, and Tactical Calldown abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't grind to reach the real game. You're already playing it.</p>", "short_description": "Eon Rush is a co-op ARPG with 20-minute competitive runs. Evolve your build mid-run, unleash decisive power spikes, and chain synergies to climb global leaderboards. No 100-hour grind required. Master Heroes from across the Eras and conquer brutal gauntlets and colossal bosses together.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557020/header.jpg?t=1783603445", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783603445", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783603445", "website": "https://www.eonrush.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Re